                "text": "This week the Supreme Court stripped from South Carolina Medicaid patients their right to receive healthcare at Planned Parenthood. It won\u2019t just stop at South Carolina. House Republicans are attempting to \u201cdefund\u201d Planned Parenthood in their Big, Ugly bill. It is all unnecessarily cruel, and people will suffer.",
