                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "This week I visited Westchester Community Health Center in Mount Vernon. I heard stories from patients about what cuts to Medicaid in the Big Ugly Bill will mean for their access to healthcare. They are, understandably, very concerned about the future. I will do all I can in Congress to blunt the effects of these careless cuts.",
