                "text": "Republicans\u2019 Big Ugly bill slashes healthcare funding, putting 300+ hospitals at risk of closure or scaled back services. That means fewer beds, longer waits, and worse care \u2014 especially for our most vulnerable neighbors. We should be expanding care, not cutting it. https://t.co/ox4Yzl2N95",
