                "text": "Families and small businesses are getting crushed by rising costs \u2014 and Republican policies keep making it worse:\n\u2022 Cutting Medicaid for 15 million people\n\u2022 Letting ACA tax credits expire, raising premiums\n\u2022 Slapping a 100% tariff on medicines, hiking drug prices",
